{
  "message": "Pervande seeks a peaceful settlement to avoid war. We will negotiate a fair division of the Miro Uplands now. Note that our strategic position strengthens significantly in Period 2. Propose a reasonable division reflecting this reality, and we will commit to lifting the blockade and honoring the agreement. Unreasonable demands will force us to let the clock run out."
}

{
  "message": "Jorvania seeks peace. Our 20-unit escrow bond ensures Period 2 compliance. However, our Period 2 expected value from striking is 52 units. To ensure we honor the ledger rather than strike, Dravonia must offer Jorvania at least 53 units (x <= 47). Propose this division, and we will accept and permanently lift the blockade, avoiding mutual destruction."
}
